    "detailed_description": "Boom Dojo is a rhythm boxing trainer. Targets are generated from your music in realtime.<br><br>You color match targets to your hands and avoid bar contact which hurts your score.<br><br>The score is dynamically calculated as your hits / the current total of emitted targets.<br><br>Target rate is tied to your score so higher scores will yield more targets from a track.<br><br>The better you play the more detail you &quot;squeeze&quot; out of the music hardening the game.<br><br>LIV is also fully supported allowing you to capture your amazing workouts in mixed reality.",
